{"code":"var root=Sandbox.Project.Current.GetRootPath();var stage=System.IO.Path.Combine(root,\"output/cerroblanco/north-cctv-v1/stage\");foreach(var f in System.IO.Directory.GetFiles(stage,\"*\",System.IO.SearchOption.AllDirectories).OrderBy(x=>x.EndsWith(\".vmdl\"))){var target=System.IO.Path.Combine(root,\"Assets\",System.IO.Path.GetRelativePath(stage,f));System.IO.Directory.CreateDirectory(System.IO.Path.GetDirectoryName(target));System.IO.File.Copy(f,target,true);Editor.AssetSystem.RegisterFile(target);}return new{Imported=true};"}
